  "reports": [
    {
      "on": "2026-11-25",
      "words": "| Aegrit | on the barrel itself | 797 |\n| Aegrit | the next crossing (4 m) | 533 |\n| Aegrit | the crossing across the tile (5.66 m) | 405 |\n| Aegrit | two crossings away, in a straight line (8 m) | 182 |\n| Opticor | on the barrel itself (the 6 m explosion) | 2 numbers: 400 and 1000 probably one is direct hit |\n| Opticor | the next crossing (4 m) | 211 |\n| Opticor | the crossing across the tile (5.66 m) | 70 |\nArsenal, Aegrit's explosion: crit multiplier: 1.9x cd\nArsenal, Opticor's explosion: radius, falloff, crit multiplier: 6m range, 60% falloff, 2.5x cd"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Follie's barrel with its middle on a crossing of the floor's lines, 4 m apart, in the Simulacrum, no mods, and no numbers were predicted to Pavel. The barrel is a neutral target. Opticor charged fully. The numbers are up to 9 cm nearer and 2 cm further than the crossings, so the tolerance is a decimetre. Aegrit's explosion crits for 1.9x by the arsenal, as Pavel read it, where the wiki says 2x. The wiki's straight line would show 549, 446 and 301, and 240 and 174. Aegrit and Opticor are not in the library yet.",
